               PERFORM FORMAT-MODEL-0004.
               PERFORM EXPAND-BEDROOMS-0005.
               PERFORM REFRESH-HOUSE-TYPE-0006.
               PERFORM SEND-RECEIVE-MAP-0007.
               PERFORM DERIVE-EQUITIES-0008.
               PERFORM DERIVE-ROOF-TYPE-0009.
               PERFORM NORMALISE-BROKER-ID-0010.
               PERFORM APPLY-VALUE-0011.
               PERFORM CHECK-BEDROOMS-0013.
               EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       CALL-ZPA00GWG-001.
               EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM('ZPA00GWG')
